#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:28
msgid ""
"System admins managing a self-hosted Mattermost deployment can edit the "
"``config.json`` file as described in the following tables. Each "
"configuration value below includes a JSON path to access the value "
"programmatically in the ``config.json`` file using a JSON-aware tool. For"
" example, the ``EnableUserCreation`` value is under ``TeamSettings``."
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 OKR.BEST 배포를 관리하는 시스템 관리자는 다음 표에 설명된 대로 ``config.json`` 파일을 편집할 수 있습니다. 아래의 각 구성 값에는 JSON 인식 도구를 사용하여 ``config.json`` 파일에서 프로그래밍 방식으로 값에 접근할 수 있는 JSON 경로가 포함되어 있습니다. 예를 들어 ``EnableUserCreation`` 값은 ``TeamSettings`` 아래에 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:30
msgid ""
"If using a tool such as `jq <https://stedolan.github.io/jq/>`__, you'd "
"enter: ``cat config/config.json | jq '.TeamSettings.EnableUserCreation'``"
msgstr "`jq <https://stedolan.github.io/jq/>`__와 같은 도구를 사용하는 경우 다음을 입력합니다: ``cat config/config.json | jq '.TeamSettings.EnableUserCreation'``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:31
msgid ""
"When working with the ``config.json`` file manually, look for an object "
"such as ``TeamSettings``, then within that object, find the key "
"``EnableUserCreation``."
msgstr "``config.json`` 파일을 수동으로 작업할 때는 ``TeamSettings``와 같은 객체를 찾은 다음 그 객체 안에서 ``EnableUserCreation`` 키를 찾습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:36
msgid "Signup"
msgstr "가입"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:38
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Authentication > Signup**."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Authentication > Signup**으로 이동하여 다음 구성 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:50
msgid "Enable account creation"
msgstr "계정 생성 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:53
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Anyone can sign up for a user account on this "
"server without needing to be invited. Applies to email-based signups "
"only."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 누구나 초대 없이 이 서버에서 사용자 계정에 가입할 수 있습니다. 이메일 기반 가입에만 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:56
msgid ""
"**false**: The ability to create accounts is disabled. Selecting **Create"
" Account** displays an error. Applies to email, OpenID Connect, and OAuth"
" 2.0 user account authentication."
msgstr "**false**: 계정 생성 기능이 비활성화됩니다. **Create Account**를 선택하면 오류가 표시됩니다. 이메일, OpenID Connect, OAuth 2.0 사용자 계정 인증에 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:53
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:100
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:118
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:131
msgid "System Config path: **Authentication > Signup**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Authentication > Signup**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:54
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``TeamSettings`` > ``EnableUserCreation`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``EnableUserCreation`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:55
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLEUSERCREATION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLEUSERCREATION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:62
msgid ""
"LDAP and SAML users can always create a Mattermost account by logging in "
"using LDAP or SAML user credentials, regardless of whether this "
"configuration setting is enabled."
msgstr "LDAP 및 SAML 사용자는 이 구성 설정의 활성화 여부와 관계없이 LDAP 또는 SAML 사용자 자격 증명으로 로그인하여 언제든지 OKR.BEST 계정을 생성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:63
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:206
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v10.9, email addresses enclosed in angle brackets (e.g., "
"``<billy@example.com>``) will be rejected. To avoid issues, ensure all "
"user emails comply with the plain address format (e.g., "
"``billy@example.com``). In addition, we strongly recommend taking "
"proactive steps to audit and update Mattermost user data to align with "
"this product change, as impacted users may face issues accessing "
"Mattermost or managing their user profile. You can update these user "
"emails manually using :ref:`mmctl user email <administration-guide/manage"
"/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl user email>`."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v10.9부터 꺾쇠 괄호로 묶인 이메일 주소(예: ``<billy@example.com>``)는 거부됩니다. 문제를 방지하려면 모든 사용자 이메일이 일반 주소 형식(예: ``billy@example.com``)을 준수하는지 확인하세요. 또한 영향을 받는 사용자가 OKR.BEST 접근이나 사용자 프로필 관리에 문제를 겪을 수 있으므로, 이 제품 변경 사항에 맞게 OKR.BEST 사용자 데이터를 점검하고 업데이트하는 사전 조치를 취할 것을 강력히 권장합니다. :ref:`mmctl user email <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl user email>`을 사용하여 이러한 사용자 이메일을 수동으로 업데이트할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:64
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1170
msgid ""
"See the encryption options documentation for details on what "
":ref:`encryption methods <deployment-guide/encryption-options:saml "
"encryption support>` Mattermost supports for SAML."
msgstr "OKR.BEST가 SAML에 대해 지원하는 :ref:`암호화 방식 <deployment-guide/encryption-options:saml encryption support>`에 대한 자세한 내용은 암호화 옵션 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:79
msgid "Restrict account creation to specified email domains"
msgstr "계정 생성을 지정된 이메일 도메인으로 제한"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:82
msgid ""
"This setting limits the email address domains that can be used to create "
"a new account or team."
"                                                        | - System Config"
" path: **Authentication > Signup** You **must** set :ref:`Require Email "
"Verification <administration-guide/configure/authentication-"
"configuration-settings:require email verification>`   | - ``config.json``"
" setting: ``TeamSettings`` > ``RestrictCreationToDomains`` to ``true`` "
"for the restriction to function. This setting only affects email login."
"                                                                    | - "
"Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_RESTRICTCREATIONTODOMAINS``"
msgstr "이 설정은 새 계정이나 팀을 생성하는 데 사용할 수 있는 이메일 주소 도메인을 제한합니다.                                                        | - 관리자 도구 경로: **Authentication > Signup** 제한이 작동하려면 :ref:`Require Email Verification <administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings:require email verification>`을 **반드시** 설정해야 합니다.   | - ``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``RestrictCreationToDomains``를 ``true``로 설정합니다. 이 설정은 이메일 로그인에만 영향을 줍니다.                                                                    | - 환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_RESTRICTCREATIONTODOMAINS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:97
msgid "Enable open server"
msgstr "오픈 서버 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:100
msgid "**true**: Users can create accounts on the server without an invitation."
msgstr "**true**: 사용자가 초대 없이 서버에서 계정을 생성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:101
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Users **must** have an invitation to create an "
"account on the server."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 사용자가 서버에서 계정을 생성하려면 초대를 **반드시** 받아야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:101
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``TeamSettings`` > ``EnableOpenServer``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``TeamSettings`` > ``EnableOpenServer``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:102
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLEOPENSERVER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLEOPENSERVER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:115
msgid "Enable email invitations"
msgstr "이메일 초대 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:118
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default for Cloud deployments)** Allows users to send email "
"invitations."
msgstr "**true**: **(Cloud 배포 기본값)** 사용자가 이메일 초대를 보낼 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:120
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default for self-hosted deployments)** Disables email "
"invitations."
msgstr "**false**: **(셀프 호스팅 배포 기본값)** 이메일 초대를 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:119
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableEmailInvitations``"
" > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableEmailInvitations`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:120
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEEMAILINVITATIONS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEEMAILINVITATIONS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:125
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:162
