#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:139
msgid "Email"
msgstr "이메일"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:141
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Authentication > Email**."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Authentication > Email**로 이동하여 다음 구성 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:153
msgid "Enable account creation with email"
msgstr "이메일로 계정 생성 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:156
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Allows creation of team and user accounts with "
"email and password."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 이메일과 비밀번호로 팀 및 사용자 계정을 생성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:157
msgid ""
"**false**: Disables creation of team and user accounts with email and "
"password. Requires a single sign-on (SSO) service to create accounts."
msgstr "**false**: 이메일과 비밀번호로 팀 및 사용자 계정을 생성하는 기능을 비활성화합니다. 계정을 생성하려면 SSO(Single Sign-On) 서비스가 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:156
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:177
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:198
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:222
msgid "System Config path: **Authentication > Email**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Authentication > Email**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:157
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``EnableSignUpWithEmail``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``EnableSignUpWithEmail``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:158
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_ENABLESIGNUPWITHEMAIL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_ENABLESIGNUPWITHEMAIL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:174
msgid "Require email verification"
msgstr "이메일 확인 요구"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:177
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default for Cloud deployments)** Requires email verification"
" for new accounts before allowing the user to sign-in."
msgstr "**true**: **(Cloud 배포 기본값)** 새 계정에 대해 사용자가 로그인하기 전에 이메일 확인을 요구합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:180
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default for self-hosted deployments)** Disables email "
"verification. can be used to speed development by skipping the "
"verification process."
msgstr "**false**: **(셀프 호스팅 배포 기본값)** 이메일 확인을 비활성화합니다. 확인 과정을 건너뛰어 개발 속도를 높이는 데 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:178
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``RequireEmailVerification``"
" > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``RequireEmailVerification`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:179
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_REQUIREEMAILVERIFICATION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_REQUIREEMAILVERIFICATION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:195
msgid "Enable sign-in with email"
msgstr "이메일로 로그인 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:198
msgid "**true**: **(Default)** Allows users to sign-in with email and password."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 사용자가 이메일과 비밀번호로 로그인할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:199
msgid ""
"**false**: Disables authentication with email and password, and removes "
"the option from the login screen. Use this option to limit authentication"
" to single sign-on services."
msgstr "**false**: 이메일과 비밀번호를 통한 인증을 비활성화하고 로그인 화면에서 해당 옵션을 제거합니다. 인증을 SSO 서비스로 제한하려면 이 옵션을 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:199
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``EnableSignInWithEmail``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``EnableSignInWithEmail``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:200
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_ENABLESIGNINWITHEMAIL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_ENABLESIGNINWITHEMAIL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:205
msgid ""
"To provide users with only a single email sign in option on the login "
"page, ensure that the `enable sign-in with username <#enable-sign-in-"
"with-username>`__ configuration setting is set to **false**."
msgstr "로그인 페이지에서 사용자에게 단일 이메일 로그인 옵션만 제공하려면 `enable sign-in with username <#enable-sign-in-with-username>`__ 구성 설정이 **false**로 설정되어 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:219
msgid "Enable sign-in with username"
msgstr "사용자 이름으로 로그인 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:222
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Allows authentication with a username and "
"password for accounts created with an email address. This setting does "
"not affect AD/LDAP sign-in."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** 이메일 주소로 생성된 계정에 대해 사용자 이름과 비밀번호를 통한 인증을 허용합니다. 이 설정은 AD/LDAP 로그인에는 영향을 주지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:225
msgid ""
"**false**: Disables authenticaton with a username and removes the sign in"
" option from. from the login screen."
msgstr "**false**: 사용자 이름을 통한 인증을 비활성화하고 로그인 화면에서 해당 로그인 옵션을 제거합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:223
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``EnableSignInWithUsername``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``EmailSettings`` > ``EnableSignInWithUsername``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:224
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_ENABLESIGNINWITHUSERNAME``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_ENABLESIGNINWITHUSERNAME``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:230
msgid ""
"We highly recommended that email-based authentication is only used in "
"small teams on private networks."
msgstr "이메일 기반 인증은 사설 네트워크의 소규모 팀에서만 사용할 것을 강력히 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:235
msgid "Password"
msgstr "비밀번호"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:237
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Authentication > Password**."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Authentication > Password**로 이동하여 다음 구성 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:241
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v11.0, password hashing uses PBKDF2 for enhanced "
"security. User passwords are automatically migrated when they log in "
"after upgrading to v11.0 or later. This migration is progressive and "
"happens transparently when users authenticate."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v11.0부터 비밀번호 해싱은 보안 강화를 위해 PBKDF2를 사용합니다. v11.0 이상으로 업그레이드한 후 사용자가 로그인하면 사용자 비밀번호가 자동으로 마이그레이션됩니다. 이 마이그레이션은 점진적으로 이루어지며 사용자가 인증할 때 투명하게 진행됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:251
msgid "Minimum password length"
msgstr "최소 비밀번호 길이"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:254
msgid ""
"This setting determines the minimum number of characters in passwords. It"
" must be a whole number greater than or equal to 5 and less than or equal"
" to 72."
msgstr "이 설정은 비밀번호의 최소 문자 수를 결정합니다. 5 이상 72 이하의 정수여야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:256
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **5**."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **5**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:254
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:291
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:314
msgid "System Config path: **Authentication > Password**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Authentication > Password**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:255
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``PasswordSettings`` > ``MinimumLength``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``PasswordSettings`` > ``MinimumLength``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:256
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_PASSWORDSETTINGS_MINIMUMLENGTH``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_PASSWORDSETTINGS_MINIMUMLENGTH``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:288
msgid "Password requirements"
msgstr "비밀번호 요구 사항"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:291
msgid ""
"This setting controls password character requirements. By checking the "
"corresponding box, passwords must contain:"
msgstr "이 설정은 비밀번호 문자 요구 사항을 제어합니다. 해당 상자를 선택하면 비밀번호에 다음이 포함되어야 합니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:293
msgid "**At least one lowercase letter**"
msgstr "**소문자 한 개 이상**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:294
msgid "**At least one uppercase letter**"
msgstr "**대문자 한 개 이상**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:295
msgid "**At least one number**"
msgstr "**숫자 한 개 이상**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:296
msgid "**At least one symbol** out of these: ``!\"#$%&'()*+,-./:;<=>?@[]^_`|~``."
msgstr "다음 중 **기호 한 개 이상**: ``!\"#$%&'()*+,-./:;<=>?@[]^_`|~``."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:298
msgid ""
"The error message previewed in the System Console will appear if the user"
" attempts to set an invalid password."
msgstr "사용자가 유효하지 않은 비밀번호를 설정하려고 하면 관리자 도구에서 미리 보기로 표시된 오류 메시지가 나타납니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:300
msgid ""
"The default for all boxes is unchecked. The default for all settings in "
"``config.json`` is ``false``."
msgstr "모든 상자의 기본값은 선택 해제 상태입니다. ``config.json``의 모든 설정 기본값은 ``false``입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:292
msgid ""
"``config.json`` settings: ``PasswordSettings`` > ``Lowercase`` > "
"``false``, ``PasswordSettings`` > ``Uppercase`` > ``false``, "
"``PasswordSettings`` > ``Number`` > ``false``, ``PasswordSettings`` > "
"``Symbol`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``PasswordSettings`` > ``Lowercase`` > ``false``, ``PasswordSettings`` > ``Uppercase`` > ``false``, ``PasswordSettings`` > ``Number`` > ``false``, ``PasswordSettings`` > ``Symbol`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:293
msgid ""
"Environment variables: ``MM_PASSWORDSETTINGS_LOWERCASE``, "
"``MM_PASSWORDSETTINGS_UPPERCASE``, ``MM_PASSWORDSETTINGS_NUMBER``, "
"``MM_PASSWORDSETTINGS_SYMBOL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_PASSWORDSETTINGS_LOWERCASE``, ``MM_PASSWORDSETTINGS_UPPERCASE``, ``MM_PASSWORDSETTINGS_NUMBER``, ``MM_PASSWORDSETTINGS_SYMBOL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:311
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:657
msgid "Maximum login attempts"
msgstr "최대 로그인 시도 횟수"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:314
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:660
msgid ""
"This setting determines the number of failed sign-in attempts a user can "
"make before being locked out and required to go through a password reset "
"by email."
msgstr "이 설정은 사용자가 잠기고 이메일을 통한 비밀번호 재설정을 거쳐야 하기 전까지 시도할 수 있는 로그인 실패 횟수를 결정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:316
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:665
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **10**."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **10**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:315
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``MaximumLoginAttempts`` >"
" ``10``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``MaximumLoginAttempts`` > ``10``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:316
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_MAXIMUMLOGINATTEMPTS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_MAXIMUMLOGINATTEMPTS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:330
msgid "Enable forgot password link"
msgstr "비밀번호 찾기 링크 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:333
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Displays the **Forget Password** link on the "
"Mattermost login page."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST 로그인 페이지에 **Forget Password** 링크를 표시합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:335
msgid ""
"**false**: Hides the **Forgot Password** link from the Mattermost login "
"page."
msgstr "**false**: OKR.BEST 로그인 페이지에서 **Forgot Password** 링크를 숨깁니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:333
msgid "System Config path: **Authentication > Enable forgot password link**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Authentication > Enable forgot password link**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:334
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``ForgotPasswordLink`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``ForgotPasswordLink`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:335
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_FORGOTPASSWORDLINK``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_FORGOTPASSWORDLINK``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:339
msgid ""
"You can customize the **Forgot Password** link URL by going to **Site "
"Configuration > Customization > Forgot Password Custom Link**. See the "
":ref:`configuration <administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-"
"settings:forgot password custom link>` documentation for details."
msgstr "**Site Configuration > Customization > Forgot Password Custom Link**로 이동하여 **Forgot Password** 링크 URL을 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`구성 <administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:forgot password custom link>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:345
msgid "MFA"
msgstr "MFA"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:350
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Authentication > MFA**."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Authentication > MFA**로 이동하여 다음 구성 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:352
msgid ""
"We recommend deploying Mattermost within your own private network, and "
"using VPN clients for mobile access, so that Mattermost is secured with "
"your existing protocols. If you choose to run Mattermost outside your "
"private network, bypassing your existing security protocols, we recommend"
" adding a multi-factor authentication service specifically for accessing "
"Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST를 자체 사설 네트워크 내에 배포하고 모바일 접근에는 VPN 클라이언트를 사용하여 OKR.BEST가 기존 프로토콜로 보안되도록 하는 것을 권장합니다. 기존 보안 프로토콜을 우회하여 사설 네트워크 외부에서 OKR.BEST를 실행하기로 선택한 경우, OKR.BEST 접근 전용 다단계 인증 서비스를 추가할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:364
msgid "Enable multi-factor authentication"
msgstr "다단계 인증 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:367
msgid ""
"**true**: Users who sign-in with AD/LDAP or an email address have the "
"option to add :doc:`multi-factor authentication </administration-"
"guide/onboard/multi-factor-authentication>` to their accounts."
msgstr "**true**: AD/LDAP 또는 이메일 주소로 로그인하는 사용자가 자신의 계정에 :doc:`다단계 인증 </administration-guide/onboard/multi-factor-authentication>`을 추가할 수 있는 옵션을 갖습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:369
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Disables multi-factor authentication."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 다단계 인증을 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:367
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:386
msgid "System Config path: **Authentication > MFA**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Authentication > MFA**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:368
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``EnableMultifactorAuthentication`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableMultifactorAuthentication`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:369
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEMULTIFACTORAUTHENTICATION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEMULTIFACTORAUTHENTICATION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:383
msgid "Enforce multi-factor authentication"
msgstr "다단계 인증 강제"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:386
msgid ""
"**true**: Requires :doc:`multi-factor authentication (MFA) "
"</administration-guide/onboard/multi-factor-authentication>` for users "
"who sign-in with AD/LDAP or an email address. New users must set up MFA. "
"Logged in users are redirected to the MFA setup page until configuration "
"is complete."
msgstr "**true**: AD/LDAP 또는 이메일 주소로 로그인하는 사용자에게 :doc:`다단계 인증(MFA) </administration-guide/onboard/multi-factor-authentication>`을 요구합니다. 새 사용자는 MFA를 설정해야 합니다. 로그인한 사용자는 구성이 완료될 때까지 MFA 설정 페이지로 리디렉션됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:391
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** MFA is optional."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** MFA는 선택 사항입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:387
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``EnforceMultifactorAuthentication`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnforceMultifactorAuthentication`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:388
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENFORCEMULTIFACTORAUTHENTICATION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENFORCEMULTIFACTORAUTHENTICATION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:395
msgid ""
"If your system has users who authenticate with methods other than AD/LDAP"
" and email, MFA must be enforced with the authentication provider outside"
" of Mattermost."
msgstr "시스템에 AD/LDAP 및 이메일 이외의 방법으로 인증하는 사용자가 있는 경우, MFA는 OKR.BEST 외부의 인증 공급자에서 강제되어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:401
msgid "AD/LDAP"
msgstr "AD/LDAP"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:403
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Authentication > AD/LDAP**. This opens the AD/LDAP setup "
"wizard with step-by-step sections and testing to help configure each "
"setting."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Authentication > AD/LDAP**로 이동하여 다음 구성 설정에 접근합니다. 그러면 각 설정을 구성하는 데 도움이 되는 단계별 섹션과 테스트가 포함된 AD/LDAP 설정 마법사가 열립니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:405
msgid "The wizard is organized into the following sections:"
msgstr "마법사는 다음 섹션으로 구성되어 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:407
msgid ""
"`Connection settings <#connection-settings>`__: Configure server "
"connection details"
msgstr "`Connection settings <#connection-settings>`__: 서버 연결 세부 정보 구성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:408
msgid "`User filters <#user-filters>`__: Set up user identification and filtering"
msgstr "`User filters <#user-filters>`__: 사용자 식별 및 필터링 설정"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:409
msgid ""
"`Account synchronization <#account-synchronization>`__: Map AD/LDAP "
"attributes to Mattermost user fields"
msgstr "`Account synchronization <#account-synchronization>`__: AD/LDAP 속성을 OKR.BEST 사용자 필드에 매핑"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:410
msgid ""
"`Group synchronization <#group-synchronization>`__: Configure group "
"settings and group attributes (if using LDAP groups)"
msgstr "`Group synchronization <#group-synchronization>`__: 그룹 설정 및 그룹 속성 구성(LDAP 그룹을 사용하는 경우)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:411
msgid ""
"`Synchronization performance <#synchronization-performance>`__: Adjust "
"synchronization timing and performance settings"
msgstr "`Synchronization performance <#synchronization-performance>`__: 동기화 타이밍 및 성능 설정 조정"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:412
msgid ""
"`Synchronization history <#synchronization-history>`__: View "
"synchronization status and manually trigger syncs"
msgstr "`Synchronization history <#synchronization-history>`__: 동기화 상태 보기 및 수동으로 동기화 실행"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:415
msgid ""
"Each section includes a **Test** option you can use to verify your "
"configuration incrementally, helping identify and resolve issues early in"
" the setup process."
msgstr "각 섹션에는 구성을 점진적으로 확인하는 데 사용할 수 있는 **Test** 옵션이 포함되어 있어 설정 과정 초기에 문제를 식별하고 해결하는 데 도움이 됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:418
msgid "Connection settings"
msgstr "연결 설정"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:420
msgid ""
"Configure your AD/LDAP server connection and basic authentication "
"settings. Use the **Test Connection** button in this section to verify "
"your server connection before proceeding to other configuration steps."
msgstr "AD/LDAP 서버 연결 및 기본 인증 설정을 구성합니다. 다른 구성 단계로 진행하기 전에 이 섹션의 **Test Connection** 버튼을 사용하여 서버 연결을 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:432
msgid "Enable sign-in with AD/LDAP"
msgstr "AD/LDAP로 로그인 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:435
msgid "**true**: Allows sign-in with AD/LDAP."
msgstr "**true**: AD/LDAP로 로그인을 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:436
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Disables sign-in with AD/LDAP."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** AD/LDAP로 로그인을 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:435
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:456
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:479
