#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:456
msgid "**true**: Mattermost periodically syncs users from AD/LDAP."
msgstr "**true**: OKR.BEST가 주기적으로 AD/LDAP에서 사용자를 동기화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:457
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Disables AD/LDAP synchronization."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** AD/LDAP 동기화를 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:457
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``EnableSync`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``EnableSync`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:458
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_ENABLESYNC``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_ENABLESYNC``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:462
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:504
msgid ""
"Synchronization with AD/LDAP settings in the System Console can be used "
"to determine the connectivity and availability of arbitrary hosts. System"
" admins concerned about this can use custom admin roles to limit access "
"to modifying these settings. See the :ref:`delegated granular "
"administration <administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-"
"administration:edit privileges of admin roles (advanced)>` documentation "
"for details."
msgstr "관리자 도구의 AD/LDAP 동기화 설정은 임의 호스트의 연결성 및 가용성을 확인하는 데 사용될 수 있습니다. 이를 우려하는 시스템 관리자는 사용자 지정 관리자 역할을 사용하여 이러한 설정의 수정 접근을 제한할 수 있습니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`위임된 세분화 관리 <administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration:edit privileges of admin roles (advanced)>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:476
msgid "Login field name"
msgstr "로그인 필드 이름"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:479
msgid ""
"This setting will display placeholder text in the login field of the "
"sign-in page. This text can remind users to sign-in with their AD/LDAP "
"credentials."
msgstr "이 설정은 로그인 페이지의 로그인 필드에 자리 표시자 텍스트를 표시합니다. 이 텍스트는 사용자에게 AD/LDAP 자격 증명으로 로그인하도록 상기시킬 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:481
msgid "String input. Default is ``AD/LDAP Username``."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본값은 ``AD/LDAP Username``입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:480
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``LoginFieldName``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``LoginFieldName``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:481
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_LOGINFIELDNAME``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_LOGINFIELDNAME``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:493
msgid "AD/LDAP server"
msgstr "AD/LDAP 서버"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:496
msgid "This is the domain name or IP address of the AD/LDAP server."
msgstr "이는 AD/LDAP 서버의 도메인 이름 또는 IP 주소입니다."

