#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:498
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_LDAPSERVER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_LDAPSERVER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:516
msgid "AD/LDAP port"
msgstr "AD/LDAP 포트"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:519
msgid "This is the port Mattermost uses to connect to the AD/LDAP server."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST가 AD/LDAP 서버에 연결하는 데 사용하는 포트입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:523
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **389**."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **389**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:520
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``LdapPort`` > ``389``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``LdapPort`` > ``389``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:521
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_LDAPPORT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_LDAPPORT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:539
msgid "Bind username"
msgstr "바인드 사용자 이름"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:542
msgid ""
"This is the username for the account Mattermost utilizes to perform an "
"AD/LDAP search. This should be an account specific to Mattermost."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST가 AD/LDAP 검색을 수행하는 데 사용하는 계정의 사용자 이름입니다. 이는 OKR.BEST 전용 계정이어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:544
msgid ""
"Limit the permissions of the account to read-only access to the portion "
"of the AD/LDAP tree specified in the **Base DN** setting."
msgstr "**Base DN** 설정에 지정된 AD/LDAP 트리 부분에 대한 읽기 전용 접근으로 계정의 권한을 제한하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:546
msgid ""
"When using Active Directory, **Bind Username** should specify domain in "
"``\"DOMAIN/username\"`` format."
msgstr "Active Directory를 사용하는 경우 **Bind Username**은 ``\"DOMAIN/username\"`` 형식으로 도메인을 지정해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:543
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``BindUsername``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``BindUsername``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:544
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_BINDUSERNAME``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_BINDUSERNAME``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:552
msgid "This field is required. Anonymous bind is not currently supported."
msgstr "이 필드는 필수입니다. 익명 바인드는 현재 지원되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:562
msgid "Bind password"
msgstr "바인드 비밀번호"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:565
msgid ""
"This is the password for the username given in the **Bind Username** "
"setting."
msgstr "이는 **Bind Username** 설정에 지정된 사용자 이름의 비밀번호입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:566
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``BindPassword``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``BindPassword``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:567
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_BINDPASSWORD``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_BINDPASSWORD``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:583
msgid "Connection security"
msgstr "연결 보안"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:586
msgid ""
"This setting controls the type of security Mattermost uses to connect to "
"the AD/LDAP server, with these options:"
msgstr "이 설정은 OKR.BEST가 AD/LDAP 서버에 연결하는 데 사용하는 보안 유형을 다음 옵션으로 제어합니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:589
msgid ""
"**None**: **(Default for self-hosted deployments)** No encryption. With "
"this option, it is **highly recommended** that the connection be secured "
"outside of Mattermost, such as by a stunnel proxy. ``config.json`` "
"option: ``\"\"``"
msgstr "**None**: **(셀프 호스팅 배포 기본값)** 암호화 없음. 이 옵션을 사용하는 경우 stunnel 프록시 등을 통해 OKR.BEST 외부에서 연결을 보안하는 것을 **강력히 권장**합니다. ``config.json`` 옵션: ``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:593
msgid ""
"**TLS**: **(Default for Cloud deployments)** Encrypts communication with "
"TLS. ``config.json`` option: ``\"TLS\"``"
msgstr "**TLS**: **(Cloud 배포 기본값)** TLS로 통신을 암호화합니다. ``config.json`` 옵션: ``\"TLS\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:595
msgid ""
"**STARTTLS**: Attempts to upgrade an existing insecure connection to a "
"secure connection with TLS. ``config.json`` option: ``\"STARTTLS\"``"
msgstr "**STARTTLS**: 기존의 안전하지 않은 연결을 TLS로 안전한 연결로 업그레이드하려고 시도합니다. ``config.json`` 옵션: ``\"STARTTLS\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:587
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``ConnectionSecurity`` > "
"``\"\"``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``ConnectionSecurity`` > ``\"\"``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:588
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_CONNECTIONSECURITY``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_CONNECTIONSECURITY``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:609
msgid "Skip certificate verification"
msgstr "인증서 확인 건너뛰기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:612
msgid ""
"**true**: Disables the certificate verification step for TLS and STARTTLS"
" connections. Use this option for testing. **Do not use** this option "
"when TLS is required in production."
msgstr "**true**: TLS 및 STARTTLS 연결에 대한 인증서 확인 단계를 비활성화합니다. 테스트용으로 이 옵션을 사용하세요. 프로덕션에서 TLS가 필요한 경우 이 옵션을 **사용하지 마세요**."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:613
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Enables certification verification."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 인증서 확인을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:613
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > "
"``SkipCertificateVerification`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``SkipCertificateVerification`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:614
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_SKIPCERTIFICATEVERIFICATION``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_SKIPCERTIFICATEVERIFICATION``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:625
msgid "Private key"
msgstr "개인 키"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:628
msgid ""
"Use this setting to upload the private key file from your LDAP "
"authentication provider, if TLS client certificates are the primary "
"authentication mechanism."
msgstr "TLS 클라이언트 인증서가 기본 인증 메커니즘인 경우, 이 설정을 사용하여 LDAP 인증 공급자의 개인 키 파일을 업로드합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:629
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``PrivateKeyFile``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``PrivateKeyFile``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:630
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_PRIVATEKEYFILE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_PRIVATEKEYFILE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:641
msgid "Public certificate"
msgstr "공개 인증서"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:644
msgid ""
"Use this setting to upload the public TLS certificate from your LDAP "
"authentication provider, if TLS client certificates are the primary "
"authentication mechanism."
msgstr "TLS 클라이언트 인증서가 기본 인증 메커니즘인 경우, 이 설정을 사용하여 LDAP 인증 공급자의 공개 TLS 인증서를 업로드합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:645
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``PublicCertificateFile``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``PublicCertificateFile``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:646
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_PUBLICCERTIFICATEFILE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_PUBLICCERTIFICATEFILE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:662
msgid ""
"You can unlock the account in System Console on the users page. Setting "
"this value lower than your LDAP maximum login attempts ensures that the "
"users won't be locked out of your LDAP server because of failed login "
"attempts in Mattermost."
msgstr "관리자 도구의 사용자 페이지에서 계정 잠금을 해제할 수 있습니다. 이 값을 LDAP 최대 로그인 시도 횟수보다 낮게 설정하면 OKR.BEST에서의 로그인 실패로 인해 사용자가 LDAP 서버에서 잠기지 않도록 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:661
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``MaximumLoginAttempts`` > "
"``10``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``MaximumLoginAttempts`` > ``10``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:662
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_MAXIMUMLOGINATTEMPTS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_MAXIMUMLOGINATTEMPTS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:670
msgid ""
"Adjust this value to align with your organization’s authentication "
"policies."
msgstr "조직의 인증 정책에 맞게 이 값을 조정하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:671
msgid ""
"If a user's account is locked, you can unlock it manually by going to "
"**System console > User Management > Users**."
msgstr "사용자의 계정이 잠긴 경우 **System console > User Management > Users**로 이동하여 수동으로 잠금을 해제할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:675
msgid "User filters"
msgstr "사용자 필터"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:677
msgid ""
"Define how Mattermost identifies and filters users and groups from your "
"AD/LDAP directory. Use the **Test Filters** button in this section to "
"verify your filters work correctly before proceeding to other "
"configuration steps."
msgstr "OKR.BEST가 AD/LDAP 디렉터리에서 사용자와 그룹을 식별하고 필터링하는 방법을 정의합니다. 다른 구성 단계로 진행하기 전에 이 섹션의 **Test Filters** 버튼을 사용하여 필터가 올바르게 작동하는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:687
msgid "Base DN"
msgstr "Base DN"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:690
msgid ""
"This is the **Base Distinguished Name** of the location in the AD/LDAP "
"tree where Mattermost will start searching for users."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST가 사용자 검색을 시작할 AD/LDAP 트리 위치의 **Base Distinguished Name**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:691
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``BaseDN``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``BaseDN``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:692
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_BASEDN``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_BASEDN``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:703
msgid "User filter"
msgstr "사용자 필터"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:706
msgid ""
"This setting accepts a `general syntax "
"<https://www.ldapexplorer.com/en/manual/109010000-ldap-filter-"
"syntax.htm>`__ AD/LDAP filter that is applied when searching for user "
"objects. Only the users selected by the query can access Mattermost. For "
"example, to filter out disabled users, the filter is: "
"``(&(objectCategory=Person)(!(UserAccountControl:1.2.840.113556.1.4.803:=2)))``."
msgstr "이 설정은 사용자 객체를 검색할 때 적용되는 `일반 구문 <https://www.ldapexplorer.com/en/manual/109010000-ldap-filter-syntax.htm>`__ AD/LDAP 필터를 허용합니다. 쿼리로 선택된 사용자만 OKR.BEST에 접근할 수 있습니다. 예를 들어 비활성화된 사용자를 필터링하려면 필터는 다음과 같습니다: ``(&(objectCategory=Person)(!(UserAccountControl:1.2.840.113556.1.4.803:=2)))``."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:708
msgid ""
"To filter by group membership, determine the ``distinguishedName`` of the"
" group, then use group membership general syntax to format the filter. "
"For example, if the security group ``distinguishedName`` is "
"``CN=group1,OU=groups,DC=example,DC=com``, then the filter is: "
"``(memberOf=CN=group1,OU=groups,DC=example,DC=com)``. The user must "
"explicitly belong to this group for the filter to apply."
msgstr "그룹 멤버십으로 필터링하려면 그룹의 ``distinguishedName``을 확인한 다음 그룹 멤버십 일반 구문을 사용하여 필터 형식을 지정합니다. 예를 들어 보안 그룹 ``distinguishedName``이 ``CN=group1,OU=groups,DC=example,DC=com``인 경우 필터는 다음과 같습니다: ``(memberOf=CN=group1,OU=groups,DC=example,DC=com)``. 필터가 적용되려면 사용자가 이 그룹에 명시적으로 속해 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:707
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``UserFilter``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``UserFilter``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:708
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_USERFILTER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_USERFILTER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:714
msgid ""
"This filter uses the permissions of the **Bind Username** account to "
"execute the search. This account should be specific to Mattermost and "
"have read-only access to the portion of the AD/LDAP tree specified in the"
" **Base DN** field."
msgstr "이 필터는 **Bind Username** 계정의 권한을 사용하여 검색을 실행합니다. 이 계정은 OKR.BEST 전용이어야 하며 **Base DN** 필드에 지정된 AD/LDAP 트리 부분에 대한 읽기 전용 접근 권한을 가져야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:724
msgid "Group filter"
msgstr "그룹 필터"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:730
msgid ""
"This setting accepts a `general syntax "
"<https://www.ldapexplorer.com/en/manual/109010000-ldap-filter-"
"syntax.htm>`__ AD/LDAP filter that is applied when searching for group "
"objects. Only the groups selected by the query can access Mattermost."
msgstr "이 설정은 그룹 객체를 검색할 때 적용되는 `일반 구문 <https://www.ldapexplorer.com/en/manual/109010000-ldap-filter-syntax.htm>`__ AD/LDAP 필터를 허용합니다. 쿼리로 선택된 그룹만 OKR.BEST에 접근할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:732
msgid ""
"String input. Default is "
"``(|(objectClass=group)(objectClass=groupOfNames)(objectClass=groupOfUniqueNames))``."
msgstr "문자열 입력. 기본값은 ``(|(objectClass=group)(objectClass=groupOfNames)(objectClass=groupOfUniqueNames))``입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:731
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``GroupFilter``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``GroupFilter``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:732
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_GROUPFILTER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_GROUPFILTER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:736
msgid ""
"This filter is only used when AD/LDAP Group Sync is enabled. See "
":doc:`AD/LDAP Group Sync </administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap-groups-"
"synchronization>` for more information."
msgstr "이 필터는 AD/LDAP 그룹 동기화가 활성화된 경우에만 사용됩니다. 자세한 내용은 :doc:`AD/LDAP 그룹 동기화 </administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap-groups-synchronization>`를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:748
msgid "Enable admin filter"
msgstr "관리자 필터 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:751
msgid ""
"**true**: Enables the **Admin Filter** setting that designates system "
"admins using an AD/LDAP filter."
msgstr "**true**: AD/LDAP 필터를 사용하여 시스템 관리자를 지정하는 **Admin Filter** 설정을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:752
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Disables the **Admin Filter** setting."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** **Admin Filter** 설정을 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:752
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``EnableAdminFilter`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``EnableAdminFilter`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:753
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_ENABLEADMINFILTER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_ENABLEADMINFILTER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:757
msgid ""
"If this setting is ``false``, no additional users are designated as "
"system admins by the filter. Users that were previously designated as "
"system admins retain this role unless the filter is changed or removed."
msgstr "이 설정이 ``false``이면 필터에 의해 추가로 시스템 관리자로 지정되는 사용자가 없습니다. 이전에 시스템 관리자로 지정된 사용자는 필터가 변경되거나 제거되지 않는 한 이 역할을 유지합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:767
msgid "Admin filter"
msgstr "관리자 필터"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:770
msgid ""
"This setting accepts an AD/LDAP filter that designates the selected users"
" as system admins. Users are promoted to this role on their next sign-in "
"or on the next scheduled AD/LDAP sync."
msgstr "이 설정은 선택된 사용자를 시스템 관리자로 지정하는 AD/LDAP 필터를 허용합니다. 사용자는 다음 로그인 시 또는 다음 예약된 AD/LDAP 동기화 시 이 역할로 승격됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:772
msgid ""
"If the Admin Filter is removed, users who are currently logged in retain "
"their Admin role until their next sign-in."
msgstr "관리자 필터가 제거되면 현재 로그인한 사용자는 다음 로그인 시까지 관리자 역할을 유지합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:771
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``AdminFilter``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``AdminFilter``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:772
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_ADMINFILTER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_ADMINFILTER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:785
msgid "Guest filter"
msgstr "게스트 필터"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:788
msgid ""
"This setting accepts an AD/LDAP filter to apply when searching for "
"external users with Guest Access to Mattermost. Only users selected by "
"the query can access Mattermost as Guests."
msgstr "이 설정은 OKR.BEST에 대한 게스트 접근 권한이 있는 외부 사용자를 검색할 때 적용할 AD/LDAP 필터를 허용합니다. 쿼리로 선택된 사용자만 게스트로 OKR.BEST에 접근할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:790
msgid ""
"See :doc:`Guest Accounts </administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts>` "
"for more information."
msgstr "자세한 내용은 :doc:`게스트 계정 </administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts>`을 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:789
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``GuestFilter``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``GuestFilter``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:790
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_GUESTFILTER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_GUESTFILTER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:796
msgid "Account synchronization"
msgstr "계정 동기화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:801
msgid ""
"Map AD/LDAP user attributes to Mattermost user profile fields. Use the "
"**Test Attributes** button in this section to verify correct attribute "
"mapping and data synchronization before proceeding to other configuration"
" steps."
msgstr "AD/LDAP 사용자 속성을 OKR.BEST 사용자 프로필 필드에 매핑합니다. 다른 구성 단계로 진행하기 전에 이 섹션의 **Test Attributes** 버튼을 사용하여 올바른 속성 매핑과 데이터 동기화를 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:811
msgid "ID attribute"
msgstr "ID 속성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:814
msgid ""
"This is the attribute in the AD/LDAP server that is serves as a unique "
"user identifier in Mattermost."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST에서 고유한 사용자 식별자 역할을 하는 AD/LDAP 서버의 속성입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:816
msgid ""
"The attribute should have a unique value that does not change, such as "
"``objectGUID`` or ``entryUUID``. Confirm that these attributes are "
"available in your environment before making any changes."
msgstr "이 속성은 ``objectGUID`` 또는 ``entryUUID``와 같이 변경되지 않는 고유한 값을 가져야 합니다. 변경하기 전에 이러한 속성이 환경에서 사용 가능한지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:815
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``IdAttribute``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``IdAttribute``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:816
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_IDATTRIBUTE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_IDATTRIBUTE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:822
msgid ""
"If a user's ID Attribute changes, a new Mattermost account is created "
"that is not associated with the previous account. If you need to change "
"this field after users have signed-in, use the :ref:`mmctl ldap idmigrate"
" <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl ldap "
"idmigrate>` command."
msgstr "사용자의 ID 속성이 변경되면 이전 계정과 연결되지 않은 새 OKR.BEST 계정이 생성됩니다. 사용자가 로그인한 후 이 필드를 변경해야 하는 경우 :ref:`mmctl ldap idmigrate <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl ldap idmigrate>` 명령을 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:832
msgid "Login ID attribute"
msgstr "로그인 ID 속성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:835
msgid ""
"This is the attribute in the AD/LDAP server that is used for signing-in "
"to Mattermost. This is normally the same as the **Username Attribute**."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST에 로그인하는 데 사용되는 AD/LDAP 서버의 속성입니다. 일반적으로 **Username Attribute**와 동일합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:837
msgid ""
"If your team uses ``domain\\username`` to sign-in to other services with "
"AD/LDAP, you may enter ``domain\\username`` in this field to maintain "
"consistency between sites."
msgstr "팀에서 AD/LDAP로 다른 서비스에 로그인하는 데 ``domain\\username``을 사용하는 경우, 사이트 간 일관성을 유지하기 위해 이 필드에 ``domain\\username``을 입력할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:836
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``LoginIdAttribute``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``LoginIdAttribute``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:837
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_LOGINIDATTRIBUTE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_LOGINIDATTRIBUTE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:850
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1532
msgid "Username attribute"
msgstr "사용자 이름 속성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:853
msgid ""
"This is the attribute in the AD/LDAP server that populates the username "
"field in Mattermost."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST에서 사용자 이름 필드를 채우는 AD/LDAP 서버의 속성입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:855
msgid ""
"This attribute identifies users in the UI. For example, if a Username "
"Attribute is set to ``john.smith``, typing ``@john`` will show "
"``@john.smith`` as an auto-complete option, and posting a message with "
"``@john.smith`` will send a notification to that user."
msgstr "이 속성은 UI에서 사용자를 식별합니다. 예를 들어 사용자 이름 속성이 ``john.smith``로 설정된 경우 ``@john``을 입력하면 ``@john.smith``가 자동 완성 옵션으로 표시되고, ``@john.smith``로 메시지를 게시하면 해당 사용자에게 알림이 전송됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:857
msgid ""
"This is normally the same as the **Login ID Attribute**, but it can be "
"mapped to a different attribute."
msgstr "일반적으로 **Login ID Attribute**와 동일하지만 다른 속성에 매핑할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:854
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``UsernameAttribute``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``UsernameAttribute``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:855
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_USERNAMEATTRIBUTE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_USERNAMEATTRIBUTE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:870
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1514
msgid "Email attribute"
msgstr "이메일 속성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:873
msgid ""
"This is the attribute in AD/LDAP server that populates the email address "
"field in Mattermost."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST에서 이메일 주소 필드를 채우는 AD/LDAP 서버의 속성입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:875
msgid ""
"Email notifications are sent to this address. The address may be seen by "
"other Mattermost users depending on privacy settings."
msgstr "이메일 알림이 이 주소로 전송됩니다. 개인정보 보호 설정에 따라 이 주소가 다른 OKR.BEST 사용자에게 표시될 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:874
msgid "``config.json`` setting ``LdapSettings`` > ``EmailAttribute``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정 ``LdapSettings`` > ``EmailAttribute``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:875
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_EMAILATTRIBUTE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_EMAILATTRIBUTE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:888
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1622
msgid "First name attribute"
msgstr "이름 속성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:891
msgid ""
"This is the attribute in the AD/LDAP server that populates the first name"
" field in Mattermost."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST에서 이름 필드를 채우는 AD/LDAP 서버의 속성입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:893
msgid "When set, users cannot edit their first name."
msgstr "설정되면 사용자는 자신의 이름을 편집할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:895
msgid ""
"When not set, users can edit their first name in their :doc:`profile "
"settings </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile>`."
msgstr "설정되지 않으면 사용자는 :doc:`프로필 설정 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile>`에서 자신의 이름을 편집할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:892
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``FirstNameAttribute``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``FirstNameAttribute``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:893
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_FIRSTNAMEATTRIBUTE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_FIRSTNAMEATTRIBUTE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:909
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1639
msgid "Last name attribute"
msgstr "성 속성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:912
msgid ""
"This is the attribute in the AD/LDAP server that populates the last name "
"field in Mattermost."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST에서 성 필드를 채우는 AD/LDAP 서버의 속성입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:914
msgid "When set, users cannot edit their last name."
msgstr "설정되면 사용자는 자신의 성을 편집할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:916
msgid ""
"When not set, users can edit their last name as part of their "
":doc:`profile settings </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"profile>`. |"
msgstr "설정되지 않으면 사용자는 :doc:`프로필 설정 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile>`의 일부로 자신의 성을 편집할 수 있습니다. |"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:913
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``LastNameAttribute``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``LastNameAttribute``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:914
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_LASTNAMEATTRIBUTE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_LASTNAMEATTRIBUTE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:930
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1656
msgid "Nickname attribute"
msgstr "닉네임 속성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:933
msgid ""
"This is the attribute in the AD/LDAP server that populates the nickname "
"field in Mattermost."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST에서 닉네임 필드를 채우는 AD/LDAP 서버의 속성입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:935
msgid "When set, users cannot edit their nickname."
msgstr "설정되면 사용자는 자신의 닉네임을 편집할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:937
msgid ""
"When not set, users can edit their nickname as part of their "
":doc:`profile settings </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"profile>`."
msgstr "설정되지 않으면 사용자는 :doc:`프로필 설정 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile>`의 일부로 자신의 닉네임을 편집할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:934
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``NicknameAttribute``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``NicknameAttribute``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:935
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_NICKNAMEATTRIBUTE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_NICKNAMEATTRIBUTE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:951
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1673
msgid "Position attribute"
msgstr "직책 속성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:954
msgid ""
"This is the attribute in the AD/LDAP server that populates the position "
"field in Mattermost."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST에서 직책 필드를 채우는 AD/LDAP 서버의 속성입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:956
msgid "When set, users cannot edit their position."
msgstr "설정되면 사용자는 자신의 직책을 편집할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:958
msgid ""
"When not set, users can edit their position as part of their "
":doc:`profile settings </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"profile>`."
msgstr "설정되지 않으면 사용자는 :doc:`프로필 설정 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile>`의 일부로 자신의 직책을 편집할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:955
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``PositionAttribute``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``PositionAttribute``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:956
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_POSITIONATTRIBUTE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_POSITIONATTRIBUTE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:972
msgid "Profile picture attribute"
msgstr "프로필 사진 속성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:975
msgid ""
"This is the attribute in the AD/LDAP server that syncs and locks the "
"profile picture in Mattermost."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST에서 프로필 사진을 동기화하고 잠그는 AD/LDAP 서버의 속성입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:977
msgid ""
"The image is updated when users sign-in, not when Mattermost syncs with "
"the AD/LDAP server."
msgstr "이미지는 OKR.BEST가 AD/LDAP 서버와 동기화할 때가 아니라 사용자가 로그인할 때 업데이트됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:979
msgid ""
"The image is not updated if the Mattermost image already matches the "
"AD/LDAP image."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 이미지가 이미 AD/LDAP 이미지와 일치하는 경우 이미지는 업데이트되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:976
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``PictureAttribute``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``PictureAttribute``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:977
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_PICTUREATTRIBUTE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_PICTUREATTRIBUTE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:985
msgid "Group synchronization"
msgstr "그룹 동기화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:990
msgid ""
"Configure group mapping for AD/LDAP group synchronization. Use the **Test"
" Group Attributes** button in this section to verify proper group "
"attribute mapping before proceeding to other configuration steps."
msgstr "AD/LDAP 그룹 동기화를 위한 그룹 매핑을 구성합니다. 다른 구성 단계로 진행하기 전에 이 섹션의 **Test Group Attributes** 버튼을 사용하여 올바른 그룹 속성 매핑을 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1000
msgid "Group display name attribute"
msgstr "그룹 표시 이름 속성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1003
msgid ""
"This is the AD/LDAP Group Display name attribute that populates the "
"Mattermost group name field."
msgstr "이는 OKR.BEST 그룹 이름 필드를 채우는 AD/LDAP 그룹 표시 이름 속성입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1004
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``GroupDisplayNameAttribute``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``GroupDisplayNameAttribute``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1005
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_GROUPDISPLAYNAMEATTRIBUTE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_GROUPDISPLAYNAMEATTRIBUTE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1009
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1030
msgid ""
"This attribute is only used when AD/LDAP Group Sync is enabled and it is "
"**required**.  See the :doc:`AD/LDAP Group Sync documentation "
"</administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap-groups-synchronization>` for more "
"information."
msgstr "이 속성은 AD/LDAP 그룹 동기화가 활성화된 경우에만 사용되며 **필수**입니다.  자세한 내용은 :doc:`AD/LDAP 그룹 동기화 문서 </administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap-groups-synchronization>`를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1019
msgid "Group ID attribute"
msgstr "그룹 ID 속성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1022
msgid ""
"This is an AD/LDAP Group ID attribute that sets a unique identifier for "
"groups."
msgstr "이는 그룹에 대한 고유 식별자를 설정하는 AD/LDAP 그룹 ID 속성입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1024
msgid ""
"This should be a value that does not change, such as ``entryUUID`` or "
"``objectGUID``."
msgstr "이는 ``entryUUID`` 또는 ``objectGUID``와 같이 변경되지 않는 값이어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1023
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``GroupIdAttribute``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``GroupIdAttribute``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1024
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_GROUPIDATTRIBUTE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_GROUPIDATTRIBUTE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1033
msgid "Synchronization performance"
msgstr "동기화 성능"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1038
msgid ""
"Configure timing and performance settings for AD/LDAP synchronization. "
"These settings control how often Mattermost syncs with your AD/LDAP "
"server."
msgstr "AD/LDAP 동기화를 위한 타이밍 및 성능 설정을 구성합니다. 이러한 설정은 OKR.BEST가 AD/LDAP 서버와 얼마나 자주 동기화하는지를 제어합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1048
msgid "Synchronization interval (minutes)"
msgstr "동기화 간격(분)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1051
msgid ""
"This value determines how often Mattermost syncs with the AD/LDAP server "
"by setting the number of minutes between each sync."
msgstr "이 값은 각 동기화 사이의 분 수를 설정하여 OKR.BEST가 AD/LDAP 서버와 얼마나 자주 동기화하는지를 결정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1053
msgid ""
"Syncing with the AD/LDAP server will update Mattermost accounts to match "
"any changes made to AD/LDAP attributes."
msgstr "AD/LDAP 서버와의 동기화는 AD/LDAP 속성에 대한 변경 사항과 일치하도록 OKR.BEST 계정을 업데이트합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1055
msgid ""
"Disabled AD/LDAP accounts become deactivated users in Mattermost, and any"
" active sessions are revoked."
msgstr "비활성화된 AD/LDAP 계정은 OKR.BEST에서 비활성화된 사용자가 되며 활성 세션은 모두 취소됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1057
msgid ""
"Use the **AD/LDAP Synchronize Now** button to immediately revoke a "
"session after disabling an AD/LDAP account."
msgstr "AD/LDAP 계정을 비활성화한 후 즉시 세션을 취소하려면 **AD/LDAP Synchronize Now** 버튼을 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1059
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1098
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **60**."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **60**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1052
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``SyncIntervalMinutes`` > "
"``60``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``SyncIntervalMinutes`` > ``60``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1053
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_SYNCINTERVALMINUTES``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_SYNCINTERVALMINUTES``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1063
msgid ""
"LDAP syncs require a large number of database read queries. Monitor "
"database load and adjust the sync interval to minimize performance "
"degradation."
msgstr "LDAP 동기화는 많은 수의 데이터베이스 읽기 쿼리를 필요로 합니다. 데이터베이스 부하를 모니터링하고 성능 저하를 최소화하도록 동기화 간격을 조정하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1073
msgid "Maximum page size"
msgstr "최대 페이지 크기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1076
msgid ""
"This setting paginates the results of AD/LDAP server queries. Use this "
"setting if your AD/LDAP server has a page size limit."
msgstr "이 설정은 AD/LDAP 서버 쿼리 결과를 페이지로 나눕니다. AD/LDAP 서버에 페이지 크기 제한이 있는 경우 이 설정을 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1078
msgid ""
"The recommended setting is **1500**. This is the default AD/LDAP "
"``MaxPageSize``."
msgstr "권장 설정은 **1500**입니다. 이는 기본 AD/LDAP ``MaxPageSize``입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1080
msgid "A page size of **0** disables pagination of results."
msgstr "페이지 크기를 **0**으로 설정하면 결과의 페이지 분할이 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1082
msgid "Numerical input. Default is **0**."
msgstr "숫자 입력. 기본값은 **0**입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1077
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``MaxPageSize`` > ``0``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``MaxPageSize`` > ``0``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1078
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_MAXPAGESIZE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_MAXPAGESIZE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1093
msgid "Query timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "쿼리 시간 제한(초)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1096
msgid ""
"This setting determines the timeout period, in seconds, for AD/LDAP "
"queries. Increase this value to avoid timeout errors when querying a slow"
" server."
msgstr "이 설정은 AD/LDAP 쿼리의 시간 제한 기간을 초 단위로 결정합니다. 느린 서버를 쿼리할 때 시간 제한 오류를 방지하려면 이 값을 늘리세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1097
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``QueryTimeout`` > ``60``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``QueryTimeout`` > ``60``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1098
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_QUERYTIMEOUT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_QUERYTIMEOUT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1102
msgid "Synchronization history"
msgstr "동기화 기록"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1107
msgid ""
"View synchronization status and manually trigger AD/LDAP synchronization."
" This section includes the **AD/LDAP Synchronize Now** button for "
"immediate synchronization."
msgstr "동기화 상태를 보고 AD/LDAP 동기화를 수동으로 실행합니다. 이 섹션에는 즉시 동기화를 위한 **AD/LDAP Synchronize Now** 버튼이 포함되어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1110
msgid "AD/LDAP synchronize now"
msgstr "AD/LDAP 지금 동기화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1113
msgid "Use this button to immediately sync with the AD/LDAP server."
msgstr "이 버튼을 사용하여 AD/LDAP 서버와 즉시 동기화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1115
msgid ""
"The status of the sync is displayed in the table underneath the button "
"(see the figure below)."
msgstr "동기화 상태는 버튼 아래의 표에 표시됩니다(아래 그림 참조)."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1117
msgid ""
"Following a manual sync, the next sync will occur after the time set in "
"the **Synchronization Interval**."
msgstr "수동 동기화 후 다음 동기화는 **Synchronization Interval**에 설정된 시간 이후에 발생합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1121
msgid ""
"If a sync is ``Pending`` and does not complete, check that **Enable "
"Synchronization with AD/LDAP** is set to ``true``."
msgstr "동기화가 ``Pending`` 상태이고 완료되지 않으면 **Enable Synchronization with AD/LDAP**가 ``true``로 설정되어 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1123
msgid ""
"An example screenshot of an AD/LDAP Synchronization table in the "
"Mattermost System Console."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 관리자 도구의 AD/LDAP 동기화 표 예시 스크린샷."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1127
msgid "Config settings not available in the AD/LDAP Wizard"
msgstr "AD/LDAP 마법사에서 사용할 수 없는 구성 설정"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1132
msgid ""
"The following AD/LDAP configuration settings are available in the "
"``config.json`` file only and aren't available via the AD/LDAP wizard "
"interface in the System Console."
msgstr "다음 AD/LDAP 구성 설정은 ``config.json`` 파일에서만 사용할 수 있으며 관리자 도구의 AD/LDAP 마법사 인터페이스를 통해서는 사용할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1142
msgid "Re-add removed members on sync"
msgstr "동기화 시 제거된 멤버 다시 추가"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1145
msgid ""
"Enable this setting to re-add members of the LDAP group that were "
"previously removed from group-synchronized teams or channels during LDAP "
"synchronization."
msgstr "이 설정을 활성화하면 LDAP 동기화 중에 그룹 동기화된 팀이나 채널에서 이전에 제거된 LDAP 그룹 멤버를 다시 추가합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1149
msgid ""
"**true**: Members of the LDAP group who were previously removed are re-"
"added to group-synchronized teams or channels during LDAP "
"synchronization."
msgstr "**true**: 이전에 제거된 LDAP 그룹 멤버가 LDAP 동기화 중에 그룹 동기화된 팀이나 채널에 다시 추가됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1152
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Members of the LDAP group who were previously "
"removed are not re-added to group-synchronized teams or channels during "
"LDAP synchronization."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 이전에 제거된 LDAP 그룹 멤버가 LDAP 동기화 중에 그룹 동기화된 팀이나 채널에 다시 추가되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1146
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``ReAddRemovedMembers``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``LdapSettings`` > ``ReAddRemovedMembers``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1147
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_READDREMOVEDMEMBERS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_READDREMOVEDMEMBERS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1159
msgid ""
"The :ref:`mmctl ldap sync <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-"
"line-tool:mmctl ldap sync>` command takes precedence over this server "
"configuration setting. If you have this setting disabled, and run the "
"mmctl command with the ``--include-removed-members`` flag, removed "
"members will be re-added during LDAP synchronization."
msgstr ":ref:`mmctl ldap sync <administration-guide/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool:mmctl ldap sync>` 명령은 이 서버 구성 설정보다 우선합니다. 이 설정을 비활성화한 상태에서 ``--include-removed-members`` 플래그와 함께 mmctl 명령을 실행하면 제거된 멤버가 LDAP 동기화 중에 다시 추가됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1166
msgid "SAML 2.0"
msgstr "SAML 2.0"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1168
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Authentication > SAML 2.0**."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Authentication > SAML 2.0**으로 이동하여 다음 구성 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1174
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2366
msgid ""
"In line with Microsoft ADFS guidance, we recommend `configuring intranet "
"forms-based authentication for devices that do not support WIA "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/identity/ad-"
"fs/operations/configure-intranet-forms-based-authentication-for-devices-"
"that-do-not-support-wia>`_."
msgstr "Microsoft ADFS 지침에 따라 `WIA를 지원하지 않는 장치를 위한 인트라넷 양식 기반 인증 구성 <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/identity/ad-fs/operations/configure-intranet-forms-based-authentication-for-devices-that-do-not-support-wia>`_을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1186
msgid "Enable login with SAML"
msgstr "SAML로 로그인 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1189
msgid ""
"**true**: Enables sign-in with SAML. See :doc:`SAML Single Sign-On "
"</administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml>` to learn more."
msgstr "**true**: SAML로 로그인을 활성화합니다. 자세한 내용은 :doc:`SAML Single Sign-On </administration-guide/onboard/sso-saml>`을 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1190
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Disables sign-in with SAML."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** SAML로 로그인을 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1189
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1210
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1242
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1265
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1288
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1304
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1320
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1336
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1354
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1372
