#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1190
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``Enable`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``Enable`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1191
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_ENABLE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_ENABLE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1204
msgid "Enable synchronizing SAML accounts with AD/LDAP"
msgstr "SAML 계정과 AD/LDAP 동기화 활성화"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/ent-plus.rst:9
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Enterprise and Enterprise Advanced plans"
" <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr "|plans-img-yellow| `Enterprise 및 Enterprise Advanced 플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__에서 사용 가능"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1210
msgid ""
"**true**: Mattermost updates configured Mattermost user attributes (ex. "
"FirstName, Position, Email) with their values from AD/LDAP. From v10.9, "
"Mattermost checks whether a user exists on the connected LDAP server "
"during login. If the user doesn't exist on the LDAP server, login fails."
msgstr "**true**: OKR.BEST가 구성된 OKR.BEST 사용자 속성(예: FirstName, Position, Email)을 AD/LDAP의 값으로 업데이트합니다. v10.9부터 OKR.BEST는 로그인 중에 연결된 LDAP 서버에 사용자가 존재하는지 확인합니다. 사용자가 LDAP 서버에 존재하지 않으면 로그인이 실패합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1215
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Disables syncing of SAML-authenticated "
"Mattermost users with AD/LDAP. From Mattermost v10.9, Mattermost doesn't "
"check whether a user exists on the connected LDAP server during login."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** SAML로 인증된 OKR.BEST 사용자와 AD/LDAP의 동기화를 비활성화합니다. OKR.BEST v10.9부터 OKR.BEST는 로그인 중에 연결된 LDAP 서버에 사용자가 존재하는지 확인하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1211
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``EnableSyncWithLdap`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``EnableSyncWithLdap`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1212
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_ENABLESYNCWITHLDAP``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_ENABLESYNCWITHLDAP``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1222
msgid ""
"AD/LDAP synchronization must be enabled and configured through the "
"settings under **Authentication > AD/LDAP**."
msgstr "AD/LDAP 동기화는 **Authentication > AD/LDAP** 아래의 설정을 통해 활성화하고 구성해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1223
msgid ""
"Prior to Mattermost v10.9, users not present on the LDAP server could log"
" in, but would be deactivated on the next LDAP sync."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v10.9 이전에는 LDAP 서버에 없는 사용자가 로그인할 수 있었지만 다음 LDAP 동기화 시 비활성화되었습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1224
msgid ""
"See :doc:`AD/LDAP Setup </administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap>` to learn"
" more about configuring AD/LDAP."
msgstr "AD/LDAP 구성에 대해 자세히 알아보려면 :doc:`AD/LDAP 설정 </administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap>`을 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1236
msgid "Ignore guest users when synchronizing with AD/LDAP"
msgstr "AD/LDAP와 동기화 시 게스트 사용자 무시"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1242
msgid ""
"**true**: When syncing with the AD/LDAP server, Mattermost does not sync "
"any information about SAML-authenticated Guest Users from the AD/LDAP "
"server. Manage guest deactivation manually via **System Console > "
"Users**."
msgstr "**true**: AD/LDAP 서버와 동기화할 때 OKR.BEST는 AD/LDAP 서버에서 SAML로 인증된 게스트 사용자에 대한 정보를 동기화하지 않습니다. **System Console > Users**를 통해 게스트 비활성화를 수동으로 관리하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1245
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Syncing Mattermost with the AD/LDAP server "
"updates Guest User attributes and deactivates and removes SAML-"
"authenticated accounts for Guest Users that are no longer active on the "
"AD/LDAP server."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST를 AD/LDAP 서버와 동기화하면 게스트 사용자 속성이 업데이트되고 AD/LDAP 서버에서 더 이상 활성 상태가 아닌 게스트 사용자에 대한 SAML 인증 계정이 비활성화되고 제거됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1243
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``IgnoreGuestsLdapSync`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``IgnoreGuestsLdapSync`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1244
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_IGNOREGUESTSLDAPSYNC``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_IGNOREGUESTSLDAPSYNC``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1250
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1275
msgid ""
"For more information, see :doc:`AD/LDAP Setup </administration-"
"guide/onboard/ad-ldap>` for details."
msgstr "자세한 내용은 :doc:`AD/LDAP 설정 </administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap>`을 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1262
msgid "Override SAML bind data with AD/LDAP information"
msgstr "AD/LDAP 정보로 SAML 바인드 데이터 재정의"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1265
msgid ""
"**true**: If the SAML ID attribute is configured, Mattermost overrides "
"the SAML ID attribute with the AD/LDAP ID attribute. If the SAML ID "
"attribute is not present, Mattermost overrides the SAML Email attribute "
"with the AD/LDAP Email attribute."
msgstr "**true**: SAML ID 속성이 구성된 경우 OKR.BEST는 SAML ID 속성을 AD/LDAP ID 속성으로 재정의합니다. SAML ID 속성이 없는 경우 OKR.BEST는 SAML 이메일 속성을 AD/LDAP 이메일 속성으로 재정의합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1267
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Mattermost uses the email attribute to bind "
"users to SAML."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST는 이메일 속성을 사용하여 사용자를 SAML에 바인딩합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1269
msgid ""
"This setting is only available when SAML authentication is enabled and "
"AD/LDAP synchronization is enabled."
msgstr "이 설정은 SAML 인증이 활성화되고 AD/LDAP 동기화가 활성화된 경우에만 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1266
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > "
"``EnableSyncWithLdapIncludeAuth`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``EnableSyncWithLdapIncludeAuth`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1267
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_ENABLESYNCWITHLDAPINCLUDEAUTH``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_ENABLESYNCWITHLDAPINCLUDEAUTH``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1273
msgid ""
"This setting should be **false** unless LDAP sync is enabled. Changing "
"this setting from **true** to **false** will disable the override."
msgstr "이 설정은 LDAP 동기화가 활성화되어 있지 않는 한 **false**여야 합니다. 이 설정을 **true**에서 **false**로 변경하면 재정의가 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1274
msgid "SAML IDs must match LDAP IDs when the override is enabled."
msgstr "재정의가 활성화된 경우 SAML ID는 LDAP ID와 일치해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1285
msgid "Identity provider metadata URL"
msgstr "ID 공급자 메타데이터 URL"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1288
msgid ""
"This setting is the URL from which Mattermost requests setup metadata "
"from the provider."
msgstr "이 설정은 OKR.BEST가 공급자로부터 설정 메타데이터를 요청하는 URL입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1289
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``IdpMetadataURL``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``IdpMetadataURL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1290
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_IDPMETADATAURL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_IDPMETADATAURL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1301
msgid "SAML SSO URL"
msgstr "SAML SSO URL"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1304
msgid ""
"This setting is the URL where Mattermost sends a SAML request to start "
"the login sequence."
msgstr "이 설정은 OKR.BEST가 로그인 시퀀스를 시작하기 위해 SAML 요청을 보내는 URL입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1305
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``IdpURL``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``IdpURL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1306
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_IDPURL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_IDPURL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1317
msgid "Identity provider issuer URL"
msgstr "ID 공급자 발급자 URL"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1320
msgid ""
"This setting is the issuer URL for the Identity Provider for SAML "
"requests."
msgstr "이 설정은 SAML 요청에 대한 ID 공급자의 발급자 URL입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1321
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``IdpDescriptorURL``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``IdpDescriptorURL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1322
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_IDPDESCRIPTORURL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_IDPDESCRIPTORURL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1333
msgid "Identity provider public certificate"
msgstr "ID 공급자 공개 인증서"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1336
msgid "The public authentication certificate issued by your Identity Provider."
msgstr "ID 공급자가 발급한 공개 인증 인증서입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1337
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``IdpCertificateFile``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``IdpCertificateFile``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1338
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_IDPCERTIFICATEFILE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_IDPCERTIFICATEFILE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1351
msgid "Verify signature"
msgstr "서명 확인"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1354
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Mattermost checks that the SAML Response "
"signature matches the Service Provider Login URL."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST는 SAML 응답 서명이 서비스 공급자 로그인 URL과 일치하는지 확인합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1355
msgid ""
"**false**: The signature is not verified. This is **not recommended** for"
" production. Use this option for testing only."
msgstr "**false**: 서명을 확인하지 않습니다. 이는 프로덕션에서 **권장되지 않습니다**. 테스트용으로만 이 옵션을 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1355
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``Verify`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``Verify`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1356
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_VERIFY``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_VERIFY``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1369
msgid "Service provider login URL"
msgstr "서비스 공급자 로그인 URL"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1372
msgid ""
"Enter the URL of your Mattermost server, followed by ``/login/sso/saml``,"
" i.e. ``https://example.com/login/sso/saml``."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 서버의 URL 뒤에 ``/login/sso/saml``을 입력합니다. 예: ``https://example.com/login/sso/saml``."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1374
msgid "Use HTTP or HTTPS depending on the configuration of the server."
msgstr "서버 구성에 따라 HTTP 또는 HTTPS를 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1376
msgid "This setting is also known as the Assertion Consumer Service URL."
msgstr "이 설정은 Assertion Consumer Service URL이라고도 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1373
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > "
"``AssertionConsumerServiceURL``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``AssertionConsumerServiceURL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1374
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_ASSERTIONCONSUMERSERVICEURL``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_ASSERTIONCONSUMERSERVICEURL``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1387
msgid "Service provider identifier"
msgstr "서비스 공급자 식별자"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1390
msgid ""
"This setting is the unique identifier for the Service Provider, which in "
"most cases is the same as the Service Provider Login URL. In ADFS, this "
"must match the Relying Party Identifier."
msgstr "이 설정은 서비스 공급자의 고유 식별자로, 대부분의 경우 서비스 공급자 로그인 URL과 동일합니다. ADFS에서는 Relying Party Identifier와 일치해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1391
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``ServiceProviderIdentifier``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``ServiceProviderIdentifier``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1392
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_SERVICEPROVIDERIDENTIFIER``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_SERVICEPROVIDERIDENTIFIER``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1405
msgid "Enable encryption"
msgstr "암호화 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1408
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Mattermost will decrypt SAML Assertions that are "
"encrypted with your Service Provider Public Certificate."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST는 서비스 공급자 공개 인증서로 암호화된 SAML 어설션을 복호화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1409
msgid ""
"**false**: Mattermost does not decrypt SAML Assertions. Use this option "
"for testing only. It is **not recommended** for production."
msgstr "**false**: OKR.BEST는 SAML 어설션을 복호화하지 않습니다. 테스트용으로만 이 옵션을 사용하세요. 프로덕션에서는 **권장되지 않습니다**."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1409
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``Encrypt`` > ``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``Encrypt`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1410
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_ENCRYPT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_ENCRYPT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1421
msgid "Service provider private key"
msgstr "서비스 공급자 개인 키"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1424
msgid ""
"This setting stores the private key used to decrypt SAML Assertions from "
"the Identity Provider."
msgstr "이 설정은 ID 공급자의 SAML 어설션을 복호화하는 데 사용되는 개인 키를 저장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1425
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``PrivateKeyFile``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``PrivateKeyFile``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1426
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_PRIVATEKEYFILE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_PRIVATEKEYFILE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1437
msgid "Service provider public certificate"
msgstr "서비스 공급자 공개 인증서"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1440
msgid ""
"This setting stores the certificate file used to sign a SAML request to "
"the Identity Provider for a SAML login when Mattermost is initiating the "
"login as the Service Provider."
msgstr "이 설정은 OKR.BEST가 서비스 공급자로서 로그인을 시작할 때 SAML 로그인을 위해 ID 공급자에게 보내는 SAML 요청에 서명하는 데 사용되는 인증서 파일을 저장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1441
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``PublicCertificateFile``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``PublicCertificateFile``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1442
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_PUBLICCERTIFICATEFILE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_PUBLICCERTIFICATEFILE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1455
msgid "Sign request"
msgstr "요청 서명"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1458
msgid ""
"**true**: Mattermost signs the SAML request with the Service Provider "
"Private Key."
msgstr "**true**: OKR.BEST는 서비스 공급자 개인 키로 SAML 요청에 서명합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1459
msgid "**false**: Mattermost does not sign the SAML request."
msgstr "**false**: OKR.BEST는 SAML 요청에 서명하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1459
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``SamlSettings`` > ``SignRequest``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``SamlSettings`` > ``SignRequest``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1460
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_SIGNREQUEST``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_SAMLSETTINGS_SIGNREQUEST``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1471
msgid "Signature algorithm"
msgstr "서명 알고리즘"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1474
msgid ""
"This setting determines the signature algorithm used to sign the SAML "
"request. Options are: ``RSAwithSHA1``, ``RSAwithSHA256``, "
"``RSAwithSHA512``."
msgstr "이 설정은 SAML 요청에 서명하는 데 사용되는 서명 알고리즘을 결정합니다. 옵션은 다음과 같습니다: ``RSAwithSHA1``, ``RSAwithSHA256``, ``RSAwithSHA512``."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1480
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v11, the default signature algorithm has been updated "
"from ``RSAwithSHA1`` to ``RSAwithSHA256`` for improved security. Existing"
" configurations will continue to work, but new installations will default"
" to ``RSAwithSHA256``."
msgstr "OKR.BEST v11부터 보안 강화를 위해 기본 서명 알고리즘이 ``RSAwithSHA1``에서 ``RSAwithSHA256``으로 업데이트되었습니다. 기존 구성은 계속 작동하지만 새 설치에서는 기본값이 ``RSAwithSHA256``입니다."

