msgstr "**Canonical1.0**: **(기본값)** `Exclusive XML Canonicalization 1.0 (주석 생략) <https://www.w3.org/TR/2002/REC-xml-exc-c14n-20020718/>`__ (``http://www.w3.org/2001/10/xml-exc-c14n#``). ``config.json`` 설정: ``Canonical1.0``."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:1501
