msgstr "**Canonical1.1**:  `Canonical XML 1.1 (주석 생략) <https://www.w3.org/TR/2008/REC-xml-c14n11-20080502/>`__ (``http://www.w3.org/2006/12/xml-c14n11``). ``config.json`` 설정: ``Canonical1.1``."

