#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2513
msgid "This setting is the text for the OpenID login button."
msgstr "이 설정은 OpenID 로그인 버튼의 텍스트입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2514
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``OpenIdSettings`` > ``ButtonText``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``OpenIdSettings`` > ``ButtonText``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2515
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_OPENIDSETTINGS_BUTTONTEXT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_OPENIDSETTINGS_BUTTONTEXT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2526
msgid "OpenID Connect (other) Button color"
msgstr "OpenID Connect (other) 버튼 색상"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2529
msgid ""
"This setting is the color of the OpenID login button. Use a hex code with"
" a #-sign before the code, for example ``#145DBF``."
msgstr "이 설정은 OpenID 로그인 버튼의 색상입니다. 코드 앞에 #-기호가 있는 16진수 코드를 사용하세요. 예: ``#145DBF``."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2530
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``OpenIdSettings`` > ``ButtonColor``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``OpenIdSettings`` > ``ButtonColor``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2531
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_OPENIDSETTINGS_BUTTONCOLOR``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_OPENIDSETTINGS_BUTTONCOLOR``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2542
msgid "OpenID Connect (other) Discovery endpoint"
msgstr "OpenID Connect (other) Discovery 엔드포인트"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2545
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This setting stores the Discovery Endpoint URL from the OpenID provider. "
"The URL should be in the format of "
"``https://myopenid.provider.com/{my_organization}/ .well-known/openid-"
"configuration``."
msgstr "이 설정은 OpenID 공급자의 Discovery 엔드포인트 URL을 저장합니다. URL은 ``https://myopenid.provider.com/{my_organization}/ .well-known/openid-configuration`` 형식이어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2546
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``OpenIdSettings`` > ``DiscoveryEndpoint``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``OpenIdSettings`` > ``DiscoveryEndpoint``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2547
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_OPENIDSETTINGS_DISCOVERYENDPOINT``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_OPENIDSETTINGS_DISCOVERYENDPOINT``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2556
msgid ""
"The **Discovery Endpoint** setting can be used to determine the "
"connectivity and availability of arbitrary hosts. System admins concerned"
" about this can use custom admin roles to limit access to modifying these"
" settings. See the :ref:`delegated granular administration "
"<administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration:edit "
"privileges of admin roles (advanced)>` documentation for details."
msgstr "**Discovery Endpoint** 설정은 임의 호스트의 연결성 및 가용성을 확인하는 데 사용될 수 있습니다. 이를 우려하는 시스템 관리자는 사용자 지정 관리자 역할을 사용하여 이러한 설정의 수정 접근을 제한할 수 있습니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`위임된 세분화 관리 <administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration:edit privileges of admin roles (advanced)>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2568
msgid "OpenID Connect (other) Client ID"
msgstr "OpenID Connect (other) Client ID"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2571
msgid "This setting stores the Client ID from the OpenID provider."
msgstr "이 설정은 OpenID 공급자의 Client ID를 저장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2572
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``OpenIdSettings`` > ``Id``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``OpenIdSettings`` > ``Id``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2573
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_OPENIDSETTINGS_ID``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_OPENIDSETTINGS_ID``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2586
msgid "OpenID Connect (other) Client secret"
msgstr "OpenID Connect (other) Client secret"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2589
msgid "This setting stores the Client Secret from the OpenID provider."
msgstr "이 설정은 OpenID 공급자의 Client Secret을 저장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2590
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``OpenIdSettings`` > ``Secret``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``OpenIdSettings`` > ``Secret``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2591
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_OPENIDSETTINGS_SECRET``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_OPENIDSETTINGS_SECRET``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2606
msgid "OpenID Connect (other) use preferred username"
msgstr "OpenID Connect (other) 선호 사용자 이름 사용"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2619
msgid "Guest access"
msgstr "게스트 접근"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2621
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Authentication > Guest Access**."
msgstr "관리자 도구에서 **Authentication > Guest Access**로 이동하여 다음 구성 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2633
msgid "Enable guest access"
msgstr "게스트 접근 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2636
msgid "**true**: Enables the guest account feature."
msgstr "**true**: 게스트 계정 기능을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2637
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Disables the guest account feature."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 게스트 계정 기능을 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2636
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2655
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2682
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2706
msgid "System Config path: **Authentication > Guest Access**"
msgstr "관리자 도구 경로: **Authentication > Guest Access**"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2637
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``GuestAccountsSettings`` > ``Enable`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``GuestAccountsSettings`` > ``Enable`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2638
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_GUESTACCOUNTSSETTINGS_ENABLE``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_GUESTACCOUNTSSETTINGS_ENABLE``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2642
msgid ""
"Guest billing depends on channel access. Guests in exactly one channel "
"are treated as single-channel guests and don't count toward the primary "
"paid seat count. They're free up to a 1:1 ratio with licensed seats. "
"Guests in multiple channels continue to count as paid active users. "
"Direct messages and group messages don't affect whether a guest is "
"counted as a single-channel guest. See the :doc:`guest accounts "
"</administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts>` documentation for full "
"details."
msgstr "게스트 과금은 채널 접근에 따라 달라집니다. 정확히 하나의 채널에 있는 게스트는 단일 채널 게스트로 취급되며 기본 유료 좌석 수에 포함되지 않습니다. 라이선스 좌석과 1:1 비율까지 무료입니다. 여러 채널에 있는 게스트는 계속 유료 활성 사용자로 집계됩니다. 개인 메시지 및 그룹 메시지는 게스트가 단일 채널 게스트로 집계되는지 여부에 영향을 주지 않습니다. 전체 세부 정보는 :doc:`게스트 계정 </administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2652
msgid "Whitelisted guest domains"
msgstr "허용 목록에 등록된 게스트 도메인"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2655
msgid ""
"Use this setting to restrict the creation of guest accounts. When set, "
"guest accounts require a verified email address from one of the listed "
"domains."
msgstr "이 설정을 사용하여 게스트 계정 생성을 제한합니다. 설정되면 게스트 계정에는 나열된 도메인 중 하나에서 확인된 이메일 주소가 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2657
msgid "String input of one or more domains, separated by commas."
msgstr "쉼표로 구분된 하나 이상의 도메인 문자열 입력."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2656
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``GuestAccountsSettings`` > "
"``RestrictCreationToDomains``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``GuestAccountsSettings`` > ``RestrictCreationToDomains``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2657
msgid ""
"Environment variable: "
"``MM_GUESTACCOUNTSSETTINGS_RESTRICTCREATIONTODOMAINS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_GUESTACCOUNTSSETTINGS_RESTRICTCREATIONTODOMAINS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2679
msgid "Show guest tag"
msgstr "게스트 태그 표시"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2682
msgid "**true**: **(Default)** Guest tags are visible in Mattermost."
msgstr "**true**: **(기본값)** OKR.BEST에서 게스트 태그가 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2683
msgid "**false**:  Guest tags aren't visible in Mattermost."
msgstr "**false**:  OKR.BEST에서 게스트 태그가 표시되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2683
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``GuestAccountsSettings`` > ``HideTags`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``GuestAccountsSettings`` > ``HideTags`` > ``true``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2684
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_GUESTACCOUNTSSETTINGS_HIDETAGS``"
msgstr "환경 변수: ``MM_GUESTACCOUNTSSETTINGS_HIDETAGS``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2688
msgid ""
"This configuration setting applies to all Mattermost clients, including "
"web, desktop app, and mobile app. See the :doc:`guest accounts "
"</administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts>` documentation for "
"details."
msgstr "이 구성 설정은 웹, 데스크톱 앱, 모바일 앱을 포함한 모든 OKR.BEST 클라이언트에 적용됩니다. 자세한 내용은 :doc:`게스트 계정 </administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2700
msgid "Enable guest magic link authentication"
msgstr "게스트 매직 링크 인증 활성화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2706
msgid "**true**: Enables magic link passwordless authentication for guest users."
msgstr "**true**: 게스트 사용자에 대한 매직 링크 비밀번호 없는 인증을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2707
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Magic link authentication for guest users is "
"disabled."
msgstr "**false**: **(기본값)** 게스트 사용자에 대한 매직 링크 인증이 비활성화됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2707
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``GuestAccountsSettings`` > "
"``EnableGuestMagicLink`` > ``false``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 설정: ``GuestAccountsSettings`` > ``EnableGuestMagicLink`` > ``false``"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:2711
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`guest accounts <administration-guide/onboard/guest-"
"accounts:configure magic links for guests>` documentation for guest user "
"setup details."
msgstr "게스트 사용자 설정 세부 정보는 :ref:`게스트 계정 <administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts:configure magic links for guests>` 문서를 참조하세요."

